# Potential Ransomware Activity Using LegalNotice Message | T1491.001 | https://github.com/SigmaHQ/sigma/blob/master/rules/windows/registry/registry_set/registry_set_legalnotice_susp_message.yml
source="WinEventLog:Microsoft-Windows-Sysmon/Operational" EventCode=13 (TargetObject IN ("*\\SOFTWARE\\Microsoft\\Windows\\CurrentVersion\\Policies\\System\\LegalNoticeCaption*", "*\\SOFTWARE\\Microsoft\\Windows\\CurrentVersion\\Policies\\System\\LegalNoticeText*")) (Details IN ("*encrypted*", "*Unlock-Password*", "*paying*"))
